        <mxCell id="p5_note" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;How AI judges run&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;Each judge is its own claude -p process that reads only the judge copy. A script checks every answer and retries up to 3 times. Up to 50 run at once.&lt;/span&gt;" style="shape=note;size=16;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=12;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#b3a369;" vertex="1" parent="p5">
